{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "顺时针旋转 90° 可以拆成两次原地操作：先沿主对角线转置，再反转每一行。动画使用示例 1 展示矩阵从原图到转置结果，再到最终旋转结果的变化；每一步只交换矩阵中的元素，因此额外空间为 O(1)，时间复杂度为 O(n²)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>旋转图像可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;text-align:center}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.subtitle{min-height:36px;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:11px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.phase{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.board{display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,38px);gap:4px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:transform .45s,background .45s,border-color .45s}\n.cell.hot{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff;transform:scale(1.05)}\n.cell.diag{border-color:#3794ff}\n.formula{font:10px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#8d8d8d;margin:8px 0;min-height:18px}\n.legend{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:4px;border-radius:2px;vertical-align:-1px}\n.progress{margin:8px auto 0;height:3px;max-width:320px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.bar{height:100%;background:#3794ff;animation:run 9s linear infinite}\n@keyframes run{from{width:0}to{width:100%}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>顺时针旋转 90°</h1>\n<div class=\"subtitle\"><span class=\"phase\" id=\"phase\">原始矩阵</span><br><span id=\"desc\">观察元素位置</span></div>\n<div class=\"board\" id=\"board\" aria-label=\"矩阵动画\"></div>\n<div class=\"formula\" id=\"formula\">matrix = [[1,2,3],[4,5,6],[7,8,9]]</div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#0e639c\"></i>交换中</span><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"border:1px solid #3794ff\"></i>主对角线</span></div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"bar\" id=\"progressBar\" style=\"animation:none\"></div></div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst board=document.getElementById('board'),phase=document.getElementById('phase'),desc=document.getElementById('desc'),formula=document.getElementById('formula');\nconst a=[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],states=[];\nfunction snap(p,d,h=[]){states.push({a:[...a],p,d,f:JSON.stringify([a.slice(0,3),a.slice(3,6),a.slice(6)]),h});}\nsnap('原始矩阵','只交换元素, 不创建另一份结果矩阵.');\nfor(let r=0;r<3;r++)for(let c=r+1;c<3;c++){const i=r*3+c,j=c*3+r;[a[i],a[j]]=[a[j],a[i]];snap('第 1 步: 转置','交换 ('+r+','+c+') 与 ('+c+','+r+'), 只遍历对角线上方.',[i,j]);}\nfor(let r=0;r<3;r++){const i=r*3,j=i+2;[a[i],a[j]]=[a[j],a[i]];snap('第 2 步: 反转每行','第 '+r+' 行首尾交换: (r,0) ↔ (r,2).',[i,j]);}\nsnap('旋转完成','原位置 (r,c) 到达 (c,n−1−r). 时间 O(n²), 额外空间 O(1).');\n\nfunction render(s){document.getElementById('progressBar').style.width=((step+1)/states.length*100)+'%';board.innerHTML='';s.a.forEach((v,i)=>{const c=document.createElement('div');c.className='cell'+(s.h.includes(i)?' hot':'')+([0,4,8].includes(i)?' diag':'');c.textContent=v;board.appendChild(c)});phase.textContent=s.p;desc.textContent=s.d;formula.textContent=s.f}\nlet step=0;render(states[0]);setInterval(()=>{step=(step+1)%states.length;render(states[step])},2250);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n²)",
  "space_complexity": "O(1)",
  "complexity_note": "n 为方阵边长. 转置和反转各行均只交换原矩阵中的元素, 不创建另一份结果矩阵."
}
